                    {
                        "text": "Bhai, mil gaya. **Pakka diagnosis, ek line me:**\n\n**System proxy ON hai par mitmproxy CA host keychain me hai hi nahi.** Trust missing → har HTTPS handshake reject. Yahi sab kuch hang/timeout kar raha tha.\n\n**Evidence:**\n- Container mitmproxy CA fingerprint: `98:61:93:60:...:04:DD` ✅ (persistent, generated)\n- `/Library/Keychains/System.keychain` me mitmproxy cert: **0 entries**\n- `~/Library/Keychains/login.keychain-db` me mitmproxy cert: **0 entries**\n- `~/.config/warden/` directory: **gone**\n- Yet `scutil_proxy.txt`: HTTPS proxy → 127.0.0.1:8080 **enabled**\n- Mitmproxy ne khud bola JSONL me: *\"The client disconnected during the handshake. If this happens consistently for api.anthropic.com, this may indicate that the client does not trust the proxy's certificate.\"*\n- Event histogram: 484 CONNECT tunnels, 33 TLS attempts, **23 tls_failed_client** (~70% reject rate)\n\nMTU theory, addon hang theory, upstream forwarding theory — sab galat the. Container TLS direct abhi live test kiya, fine hai. Real cause: half-installed state — uninstall ne keychain wipe kar diya but system proxy chalu rahi.\n\n**Fix (in order, naya terminal me):**\n\n```bash\nbash /Users/apple/Projects/al_llm_warden/scripts/uninstall-mac.sh\nsudo killall trustd\nsleep 3\nbash /Users/apple/Projects/al_llm_warden/scripts/install-mac.sh\n# install ke browser-quit prompt pe YES\n```\n\nNaya terminal me confirm:\n```bash\necho $HTTPS_PROXY                    # http://127.0.0.1:8080\nls ~/.config/warden/                  # warden-ca-bundle.pem hona chahiye\nsecurity find-certificate -c mitmproxy /Library/Keychains/System.keychain | grep -i mitm\n# fingerprint match hona chahiye 98:61:93:60:...:04:DD se\n```\n\nPhir Chrome full quit (Cmd+Q) → reopen → `https://claude.ai` test. Pass hua → `https://api.anthropic.com/v1/models` curl test, then Claude Code.\n\nMemory update karna chahiye — bata, abhi update karoon ya install ke baad confirm karke?",
