                        "content": "100\t### Memory updates pending\n101\t\n102\t- `project_docker_bridge_mtu.md` — needs nuance: MTU 1380 fixed *container-direct* TLS handshake but is NOT the cure for user-visible failure. Real cause is upstream-side mitmproxy/addon, MTU is necessary-but-not-sufficient.\n103\t- New memory after deep-trace: capture whatever the JSONL reveals as actual root cause.\n104\t\n105\t---\n106\t\n107\t# Warden TLS Debug — Host-Chain-Break Phase (HISTORICAL — 2026-05-07)\n108\t\n109\t## RESUME PROTOCOL — older entry (kept for context)",
